WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.706 --> 00:00:10.522
Your school's yearly plan, the RPT, shows what to teach each week. Open Plan, then Yearly plan.

2
00:00:10.522 --> 00:00:18.478
Upload it as Word, Excel, CSV or PDF. Consilia reads the table on your phone. Nothing is uploaded.

3
00:00:18.478 --> 00:00:26.125
It finds the weeks, dates, topics, Learning Standards, SoW lessons and holidays, in Malay or English.

4
00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:34.117
Check it, fix anything, and choose the classes that follow it. Then save.

5
00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:38.740
Yearly shows every week, with this week highlighted.

6
00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:44.532
Monthly shows the weeks as a calendar.

7
00:00:44.532 --> 00:00:53.578
Weekly shows the topic and SoW lessons, matched to your periods this week.

8
00:00:53.578 --> 00:01:01.913
"Plan lesson 4" opens New lesson plan with the lesson, class and time already chosen.

9
00:01:01.913 --> 00:01:08.848
No file? "Build it from the Scheme of Work" lays out the lessons week by week. Next: watch "Classes and PBD".
